
How to Deploy and Use
Save the Script: Save the code above as customscript_search_bot_sl.js.

Upload to File Cabinet: Go to Documents > Files > SuiteScripts and upload the file.

Create Script Record:

Go to Customization > Scripting > Scripts > New.

Select the file you uploaded.

Name it "Search Generator Bot".

Deploy the Script:

Click Deploy Script.

Set the Status to Testing or Released.

Under the Links tab, create a link (e.g., to your Center tab) so you can easily access it.

Run the Chatbot:

Open the Suitelet URL.

In the text box, type a request like:

"Create a search for Sales Orders created last month that are in Pending Fulfillment status. Show me the Document Number, Date, and Customer Name."

Click Generate Search.

The bot will return a SuiteScript snippet using search.create({...}) that matches your criteria.
